                        "maxWidth": "420px"
                      },
                      {
                        "__component": "blocks.text",
                        "id": 206,
                        "variant": "body",
                        "content": "Vukan's Bike Shop grew out of a love of cycling and the wish for a local place for solid service, honest advice, or a new bike — whether you ride in town, on the road, or on trails.\n\nWe are based in Apače. We service and advise on all bike types; our deepest passion and longest experience are still with mountain bikes and MTB — from basic service to full repairs and custom builds. No anonymous workshop — one expert who knows your bike and your needs.\n\nWe believe in personal contact, fair pricing, and work you can rely on. If you want a partner for your next rides, you are in the right place.",
                        "color": "secondary",
                        "maxWidth": "440px"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
